Package: CompactPME
Title: Compact Principal Manifold Estimation
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Christopher", "Perez", , "cmp23b@fsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Christopher Perez [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Christopher Perez <cmp23b@fsu.edu>
Description: Estimates smooth principal curves and surfaces from noisy point
    clouds using compact one- and two-dimensional Riemannian template
    manifolds. Implementations are provided for interval, circle, and sphere
    templates, including projection-adaptation fitting and smoothing-parameter
    selection utilities.
